%% VayuLoom request flow — dashboard to autopilot advisory
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as VayuLoom web
    participant AQI as GET /api/aqi
    participant AUTO as POST /api/autopilot
    participant ENG as autopilotPlan engine
    participant DB as DynamoDB zones
    participant SNS as SNS topics
    UI->>AQI: fetch 12 zones (seed 7331)
    AQI-->>UI: zones + AQI + category
    UI->>AUTO: {aqi, zoneName, students}
    AUTO->>ENG: grapStage(aqi)
    ENG->>DB: read zone thresholds
    DB-->>ENG: GRAP band
    ENG-->>AUTO: {stage, actions}
    AUTO-->>UI: {stage, actions, sms_en, sms_hi}
    AUTO->>SNS: publish advisory (Stage III+)
    SNS-->>UI: delivery receipt
